{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_016","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"{\n\"command\" : \"feature\" ,\n\"feature\" : \"4C97EBA926031A7CF7D7B36FDE3ED66DDA5421192D63DE53FFB46E43B9DC8373\"\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 109","char_start":2681,"char_end":2787,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_017","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"The request includes the following parameters:","location_hint":"paragraph 111","char_start":2798,"char_end":2844,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_018","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"feature String (Optional) The unique ID of an amendment, as hexadecimal; or the short name of the amendment. If provided, limits the response to one amendment. Otherwise, the response lists all amendments.","location_hint":"paragraph 113","char_start":2874,"char_end":3079,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_019","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"An example of a successful response:","location_hint":"paragraph 115","char_start":3100,"char_end":3136,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_020","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"{\n\"result\" : {\n\"4C97EBA926031A7CF7D7B36FDE3ED66DDA5421192D63DE53FFB46E43B9DC8373\" : {\n\"enabled\" : false ,\n\"name\" : \"MultiSign\" ,\n\"supported\" : true\n}\n},\n\"status\" : \"success\" ,\n\"type\" : \"response\"\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 119","char_start":3192,"char_end":3389,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_021","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"The response follows the standard format , with a successful result containing a map of amendments as a JSON object. The keys of the object are amendment IDs. The values for each key are amendment objects that describe the status of the amendment with that ID. If the request specified a feature , the map contains only the requested amendment object, after applying any changes from the request. Each amendment object has the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 120","char_start":3391,"char_end":3835,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_022","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"enabled Boolean Whether this amendment is currently enabled in the latest ledger.","location_hint":"paragraph 122","char_start":3865,"char_end":3946,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_023","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"name String (May be omitted) The human-readable name for this amendment, if known.","location_hint":"paragraph 123","char_start":3948,"char_end":4030,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_024","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"supported Boolean Whether the server knows how to apply this amendment. If this field is set to false (the server does not know how to apply this amendment) and enabled is set to true (this amendment is enabled in the latest ledger), this amendment may cause your server to be amendment blocked .","location_hint":"paragraph 124","char_start":4032,"char_end":4328,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_025","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"The name for an amendment does not strictly indicate what that amendment does. The name is not guaranteed to be unique or consistent across servers.","location_hint":"paragraph 126","char_start":4343,"char_end":4491,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_026","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"Any of the universal error types .","location_hint":"paragraph 128","char_start":4512,"char_end":4546,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_027","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"badFeature - The feature specified was invalidly formatted, or the server does not know an amendment with that name.","location_hint":"paragraph 129","char_start":4548,"char_end":4664,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_e6b777fcef0d_028","source_id":"src_e6b777fcef0d","source_hash":"1bd42660ea0fca40a544af380ba3bdfe56f2690fdca040bb39d7a342b0bbad57","text":"noPermission - The server does not have permission to run the specified command. For example, this can occur if the request includes admin-only fields that are not allowed, such as the vetoed request parameter.","location_hint":"paragraph 130","char_start":4666,"char_end":4876,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T21:12:58.327Z"}
